"les entrées héritées 1209:ABD1 conservées pour les unités plus anciennes "
"(`f453bc945 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/f453bc945>`__, "
"`d55d6441f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d55d6441f>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:295
msgid ""
"**OpenMV Cam AE3** is now supported, including Windows DFU drivers, its "
