"Windows, son arborescence d'images de micrologiciel/configuration et son "
"VID/PID USB (mis à jour vers 37C5:16E3 en exécution / 37C5:96E3 en programme"
" d'amorçage) (`4a16e04c2 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/4a16e04c2>`__, `cc52e76f5 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/cc52e76f5>`__, `3f75e7de4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
