#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:302
msgid ""
"**New USB VID/PID system:** OpenMV cameras move to vendor ID ``37C5`` with "
"new bootloader/DFU IDs (e.g. 37C5:1202/9202 M4, 1203/9203 M7, 1204/9204 H7, "
"124A/924A H7 Plus, 1205/9205), relabeling old 1209:ABD1 boards as Legacy "
